      "x": -420,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 1240,
      "label": "lightbox-dialog.njk"
    },
    {
      "type": "group",
      "id": "0e6ff9eac8ec8061",
      "x": 740,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 760,
      "label": "Behavior"
    },
    {
      "type": "file",
      "id": "394d0b0642ffec6c",
      "x": -980,
      "y": -20,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300,
      "file": "dataink.io/frontend/views/molecules/figure/media.md"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "f3a9176b6ebd91be",
      "x": -980,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### PortableText image serializer\n`data/sanity/transforms/portableText.js` → `types.image`\n\n**Hand-built mirror**, not a caller. `@portabletext/to-html` returns HTML strings, so it can't import a Nunjucks macro.\n\n⚠️ Change both together — markup, classes, caption, `aria-label`."
    },
    {
      "type": "file",
      "id": "7e5bfafeba1f41c5",
      "x": -400,
      "y": -20,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "file": "dataink.io/frontend/views/molecules/lightbox/lightbox-dialog.md"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "933740080ebb33d4",
      "x": 140,
      "y": -20,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "### Params\n| Param | Use |\n|---|---|\n| `video` | `{ src, poster, mimeType }` — wins |\n| `picture` | pre-rendered HTML — wins over `src` |\n| `src` | image URL |\n| `width` / `height` | intrinsic size of `src` |\n| `alt` | `src` alt + dialog name |\n| `caption` | dialog caption |"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "2280a1ba15a14c57",
      "x": -400,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### Anatomy\n```\n<dialog data-lightbox-el=\"dialog\"\n        aria-label=alt|caption|fallback>\n  <button data-lightbox-el=\"close\">Close\n  <figure class=\"grid\">\n    media (see precedence)\n    <figcaption data-lightbox-el=\n      \"dialog-caption\">   ← if caption\n  </figure>\n</dialog>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import Lightbox.js\n```\nRoot + trigger belong to the **caller**."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "a0182bf044c7ecea",
      "x": 140,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 420,
      "text": "### Media precedence\n1. **`video.src`** → `<video data-lightbox-el=\"video\" muted playsinline controls preload=\"none\">`\n2. **`picture`** → `<span>` wrapping the HTML; inner `<img>` styled via `[&_img]:`\n3. **`src`** → `<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">` + `width`/`height` when given; `w-auto h-auto` under `max-w-full max-h-[75vh]`\n\nNothing is fetched until the dialog opens.\n\n**Fallback name:** `Video viewer` / `Image viewer` (`or`, not `default` — empty strings fall through)."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "a7e9023a1dddae02",
      "x": -400,
      "y": 780,
      "width": 1060,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "### Layout\n| Case | Result |\n|---|---|\n| No caption | Media fills dialog, max `90vw` × `75vh` |\n| Caption, below `lg` (md and smaller) | Caption **below** media |\n| Caption, `lg`+ | `lg:grid-cols-3` — media `lg:col-span-2`, caption right third; dialog fixed `lg:w-[90vw]` so the grid has a definite width |\n\nCursor: `zoom-out` on the backdrop, `auto` over content. Backdrop `bg-black/80`, caption `text-neutral-200`."
    },
    {
      "type": "file",
      "id": "4e75f8c6c1ba4609",
      "x": 760,
      "y": -20,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "file": "dataink.io/frontend/js/lightbox/Lightbox.md"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "2869e6cfed037faf",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "### Lightbox.js\n| Event | Result |\n|---|---|\n| trigger click | `showModal()` |\n| open + video | `play()` muted — **skipped** under `prefers-reduced-motion` |\n| Close / backdrop / Escape | `close()` |\n| dialog `close` event | video `pause()` |\n\nFocus trap + Escape are native `<dialog>`."
    },
    {
      "type": "file",
      "id": "e08f7450dafff63c",
